1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:02,899
This is BlockID Business Passport,

2
00:00:02,899 --> 00:00:05,875
from Sydney: know the business you invest in.

3
00:00:05,875 --> 00:00:07,763
Every shareholder, large or small,

4
00:00:07,763 --> 00:00:10,096
gets a live view of the business they own,

5
00:00:10,096 --> 00:00:11,818
a share register on blockchain,

6
00:00:11,818 --> 00:00:14,262
and dividends paid straight to their wallet.

7
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:19,142
Today, investors lose sight of a business the day they invest.

8
00:00:19,142 --> 00:00:20,973
The numbers are hard to trust,

9
00:00:20,973 --> 00:00:22,926
ownership sits in a spreadsheet,

10
00:00:22,926 --> 00:00:25,367
and dividends are slow, or never arrive.

11
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:28,830
This is the live app, on testnet.

12
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:33,092
No sign-up: you land in a demo investor account with sample data.

13
00:00:33,092 --> 00:00:36,950
My portfolio shows each holding at the latest approved price,

14
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,405
and the dividends paid.

15
00:00:39,374 --> 00:00:40,998
Each holding shows your stake,

16
00:00:40,998 --> 00:00:43,867
a price that only moves when a new value is approved,

17
00:00:43,867 --> 00:00:47,224
and the business updates every investor gets at the same time.

18
00:00:48,194 --> 00:00:50,114
A business, or an investor,

19
00:00:50,114 --> 00:00:52,106
starts by pasting a website.

20
00:00:53,078 --> 00:00:54,835
AI agents read the site,

21
00:00:54,835 --> 00:00:57,763
find competitors and analyse the market,

22
00:00:57,763 --> 00:00:58,715
step by step.

23
00:00:58,715 --> 00:01:00,378
They hold no keys.

24
00:01:00,378 --> 00:01:02,253
They can only propose.

25
00:01:03,218 --> 00:01:04,806
The report gives a grade,

26
00:01:04,806 --> 00:01:07,030
a business score and a value range.

27
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:09,143
Every figure links to its source.

28
00:01:09,143 --> 00:01:11,230
No source, no number.

29
00:01:12,182 --> 00:01:15,315
A person approves every step in the admin console,

30
00:01:15,315 --> 00:01:16,944
signed by an admin wallet.

31
00:01:16,944 --> 00:01:19,094
Only then does the issuer act.

32
00:01:20,066 --> 00:01:24,431
The isolated issuer creates the share register on BlockID chain and copies

33
00:01:24,431 --> 00:01:26,378
it to Ethereum and HashKey Chain.

34
00:01:26,378 --> 00:01:29,241
This cap table is read straight from the chain.

35
00:01:30,206 --> 00:01:33,973
Businesses can open share offerings with the dilution shown first,

36
00:01:33,973 --> 00:01:36,198
and dividends are paid to every wallet,

37
00:01:36,198 --> 00:01:37,568
with no gas for holders.

38
00:01:38,522 --> 00:01:39,859
Don't trust us.

39
00:01:39,859 --> 00:01:43,797
Your browser hashes the report and compares it with three blockchains.

40
00:01:43,797 --> 00:01:46,497
Change one number, and it turns red.

41
00:01:47,462 --> 00:01:52,689
On HashKey Chain, our AgentProvenance contract records which agent proposed each action,

42
00:01:52,689 --> 00:01:54,412
and which person approved it.

43
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:58,345
BlockID HR reviews the founding team.

44
00:01:58,345 --> 00:02:02,754
Each requirement of the role is checked against public sources and the

45
00:02:02,754 --> 00:02:04,895
CV: met, partly met, or not found.

46
00:02:05,846 --> 00:02:07,346
Agents propose.

47
00:02:07,346 --> 00:02:08,721
Humans approve.

48
00:02:08,721 --> 00:02:10,146
Chains prove.

49
00:02:10,146 --> 00:02:11,624
AI runs with no keys,

50
00:02:11,624 --> 00:02:14,299
one admin approval unlocks the issuer,

51
00:02:14,299 --> 00:02:16,833
and every step is recorded on chain.

52
00:02:17,786 --> 00:02:20,339
Today the whole flow runs live on testnet:

53
00:02:20,339 --> 00:02:24,471
fourteen sample listings, forty-two token contracts on three chains,

54
00:02:24,471 --> 00:02:26,355
every report verified on chain,

55
00:02:26,355 --> 00:02:28,361
and more than five hundred tests.

56
00:02:28,361 --> 00:02:30,498
We have no real users yet.

57
00:02:31,454 --> 00:02:35,302
Next: our first pilot businesses in Australia and Vietnam,

58
00:02:35,302 --> 00:02:38,154
investor communities and licensed partners.

59
00:02:38,154 --> 00:02:40,916
Try it at eth dot blockid dot au.

60
00:02:40,916 --> 00:02:41,991
Thank you.
